{"data":{"body":"[P2] Make `render()` measure the representation JSON mode actually writes. Truncation currently measures compact JSON, while export emits larger pretty-printed JSON, so a configured `maxRecordSizeBytes` can still be exceeded. Measure the pretty serialization or write the compact representation when enforcing a limit, and add a near-limit JSON-mode test.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOQwbyFc7u-jDL","finding_digest":"6eb395242402e4321f173ed5e7b9a2e3bfe30f3f505f2a9ad959ae3ecd85c808","finding_id":"arf_v1_n2zzkjbealsdehyxh3k6ponc4o","finding_key":"insight-plugin/fileexporter::render::serialized-size-fidelity","identity_key":"insight-plugin/fileexporter::render::serialized-size-fidelity","line":82,"observation_digest":"dacf3a93c5ee53bc7a16313e942399ea063eb56e978a5d625d697ca832b73612","observation_id":"aro_v1_3lhtve6f5zj3y6qwge7jii4z5i","path":"insight-plugin/src/main/java/software/amazon/lambda/durable/insight/exporters/FileExporter.java","prior_finding_id":"","published_at":"2026-09-14T20:38:10Z","review_id":"arr_v1_73go55s6yw7ve2tkufpklz322d","reviewed_base_sha":"7f1a73ca16308d31a1e5a270e504676caf890e0b","reviewed_head_sha":"c66fb370169b3201ca753b03a7ecf3c4f45d8f8f","reviewer":"codex","start_line":81,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":704},"record_id":"art_v1_4v4flf5immz3bvxf5bnv7556a2","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-09-14T20:38:10Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-java","id":1124528661},"schema_version":1}
